Camera level 3 (negronicam=3, default off) + votes. Before the first camcc access (every level,
negronicam_votes=1 default): RPMh mmcx.lvl NOM and the BCM votes of the camera NoC paths (CN0, MM1, MM0, SH0,
MC0; negroni_rpmh.c: negroni_rpmh_cam_bcm, BCM cmd-db lookup, mmcx/mxc ARC whitelist). Level 3: CPAS top +
CAMNOC (titan version, IFE_RDI_WR QoS from cpastop_v680_110.h, error logger, qchannel idle at power down) and
the apps-SMMU state of the camera stream groups (IFE 0x800/0x460, ICP 0x2000/0x5e0); negronicam_smmu=0|1|2.
Details: patches/xnu/README-camera.md.

